OL,3,GNEWSATrain worker recalls repelling
OL,4,Aattacker with frying pan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA train staff member who used a frying
OL,7,Fpan against a man accused of trying to
OL,8,Fkill 10 people on board said he did not
OL,9,Fwant to "give up until the train
OL,10,Fstopped", a court has heard.
OL,12,FSamir Zitouni was working on the York
OL,13,Fto London King's Cross LNER service on
OL,14,F1 November last year when Anthony
OL,15,FWilliams attacked, leading to an
OL,16,Funscheduled stop in Huntingdon,
OL,17,FCambridgeshire.
OL,19,FCambridge Crown Court heard Zitouni
OL,20,Fsaid he was trying to hit the knife
OL,21,FWilliams was holding and "not let him
OL,22,Fpass".
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
